1
00:00:43,768 --> 00:00:45,227
就是那儿
There.

2
00:01:41,852 --> 00:01:43,185
我的女王
My queen.

3
00:01:53,477 --> 00:01:54,560
馨德
Cinder.

4
00:01:55,977 --> 00:01:59,643
当我选择你作为少女们的容器时
When I chose you as my vessel for the maidens,

5
00:01:59,935 --> 00:02:02,060
我给予了你我的信任
I put my trust in you.

6
00:02:05,602 --> 00:02:07,352
所以 我相信
So, I trust

7
00:02:07,685 --> 00:02:11,310
你是不可能空着手回来的
that you wouldn't possibly return to me empty-handed.

8
00:02:12,727 --> 00:02:14,685
知识圣器
The Relic of Knowledge.

9
00:02:14,935 --> 00:02:17,727
是我从埃隆伍德眼皮底下带走的
I took it right from under Ironwood's nose.

10
00:02:19,477 --> 00:02:21,102
让将军栽跟头的
Outsmarting the general

11
00:02:21,143 --> 00:02:23,102
并非你的拙计
speaks less to your intellect

12
00:02:23,185 --> 00:02:25,560
而是他的愚蠢
and more to his.

13
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:31,477
说到底 是你先被那群孩子给耍了
After all, you were outsmarted by those children first.

14
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,018
我在无线电里听说
And, according to radio chatter,

15
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:37,768
那位将军和他的部下倒把你耍得团团转
that same general and his forces outsmarted you.

16
00:02:38,643 --> 00:02:40,685
真可惜 瓦特回不来了
A shame Watts never made it back.

17
00:02:43,185 --> 00:02:46,602
恐怕博士的牺牲是必要的
I'm afraid the doctor was a necessary sacrifice.

18
00:02:47,727 --> 00:02:51,227
希望这个小东西不会成为下一个
I do hope this little one doesn't become another.

19
00:02:54,977 --> 00:02:56,143
她是谁?
Who is she?

20
00:02:56,602 --> 00:02:59,727
妮奥柏莉玥的能力非常有用
Neopolitan has some very useful abilities

21
00:02:59,768 --> 00:03:02,602
她也证明了自己的价值
and has proven to be a valuable asset.

22
00:03:03,185 --> 00:03:07,060
你倒是挺喜欢收集这类"资产"的
Hm, you certainly do enjoy collecting assets.

23
00:03:14,393 --> 00:03:15,310
馨德
Cinder.

24
00:03:18,143 --> 00:03:20,018
你回来了!我就知道你会-
You're here! I knew you'd co-

25
00:03:20,060 --> 00:03:20,935
安静!
Quiet!

26
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:26,893
对一个不称职的家伙如此忠诚
So devoted to someone so incompetent.

27
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:28,810
当我和好博士
While the good doctor and I

28
00:03:28,852 --> 00:03:31,143
在执行我们的女神的意志
were advancing the will of our goddess;

29
00:03:31,185 --> 00:03:34,602
摧毁这个王国的躯干时
dismembering the very body of this kingdom...

30
00:03:35,018 --> 00:03:38,560
你却在为过去的失败赎罪
you were merely atoning for past failures.

31
00:03:38,727 --> 00:03:41,768
波伦迪娜的能力影响了
Polendina's creation interfered with the transfer

32
00:03:41,810 --> 00:03:43,268
冬之少女能力的传承
of the Winter Maiden power...

33
00:03:43,643 --> 00:03:45,435
但我现在知道能力属于她了
but now I know she has it.

34
00:03:45,768 --> 00:03:47,352
等我回到擎天
And once I return to Atlas,

35
00:03:47,393 --> 00:03:50,143
解决这个问题用不了多久
it won't take long to finish what I started.

36
00:03:51,227 --> 00:03:53,852
那个能力会是我的
That power will be mine.

37
00:03:55,727 --> 00:03:58,060
我没有下过这种命令
I've given no such command.

38
00:04:02,352 --> 00:04:04,810
陛下 现在是时候-
Ma'am, now is the time to-

39
00:04:11,602 --> 00:04:14,310
这场游戏的胜者不是你 馨德
This game is not yours to win, Cinder,

40
00:04:15,477 --> 00:04:16,393
而是我
it's mine.

41
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:22,310
虽然你对我来说比一颗棋子重要
Just because you're more valuable to me than a pawn,

42
00:04:22,352 --> 00:04:24,018
但那不代表你是棋手
does not make you a player.

43
00:04:25,602 --> 00:04:27,727
一切都准备就绪了
Everything is already in motion.

44
00:04:28,310 --> 00:04:30,268
你只需要做好一件事
All you need concern yourself with

45
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:33,310
就是乖乖执行我的命令
is your ability to act when I tell you to.

46
00:04:35,393 --> 00:04:36,435
当然
Of course.

47
00:04:38,852 --> 00:04:40,852
没有您 我什么都不是
Without you I am nothing.

48
00:05:17,185 --> 00:05:17,893
呃啊?
Huh?

49
00:05:26,143 --> 00:05:27,102
谢谢您
Thank you.

50
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:32,852
小心
Heads up.

51
00:05:44,185 --> 00:05:45,310
要搭便车吗?
Need a lift?

52
00:06:01,435 --> 00:06:04,060
我还以为将军能听进去话 真蠢
I was stupid to think the General would listen.

53
00:06:05,602 --> 00:06:07,727
我做的每一个选择都是错的
Every choice I've made was the wrong one,

54
00:06:08,227 --> 00:06:09,435
而现在.
and now...

55
00:06:13,810 --> 00:06:16,185
我们都做了问心无愧的决定
We all did what we thought was best.

56
00:06:17,143 --> 00:06:18,560
幸好你没事
I'm just glad you're alright.

57
00:06:25,477 --> 00:06:27,310
好啦好啦看到你啦
Yeah, yeah, I see you.

58
00:06:29,602 --> 00:06:31,185
快! 进来!
Inside! Hurry!

59
00:06:37,435 --> 00:06:39,810
我知道第三区是最需要援助的
I know, Sector 3 is going to need to most help.

60
00:06:40,060 --> 00:06:41,852
我会立刻给你派增援
I'm sending backup your way right now.

61
00:06:42,227 --> 00:06:43,435
斐欧娜 你听到了吗?
Fiona, do you copy?

62
00:06:43,768 --> 00:06:45,935
我们需要从第三区到弹坑的运输机
We need transport from Sector 3 to the crater.

63
00:06:46,227 --> 00:06:47,102
收到!
Copy!

64
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:05,435
听到你独自去追埃隆伍德的时候 我们…
When we heard you went off after Ironwood on your own, we...

65
00:07:07,102 --> 00:07:09,185
你怎么会跑到贫民窟去?
How did you end up down in the slums?

66
00:07:10,143 --> 00:07:14,352
这是个… 很长的故事了
It's a... (sighs) long story.

67
00:07:15,143 --> 00:07:17,685
看起来你们今晚也经历了不少
I get the feeling there's been a few of those tonight.

68
00:07:22,643 --> 00:07:23,977
你不打算告诉他们吗?
You're not going to tell them?

69
00:07:24,352 --> 00:07:25,977
我们之间的问题还没处理完呢
You and I aren't done talking yet.

70
00:07:28,185 --> 00:07:29,893
克罗人呢?
Where's Qrow?

71
00:07:35,810 --> 00:07:37,018
我们不知道
We don't know.

72
00:07:37,810 --> 00:07:39,893
我们最后一次收到的消息是他跟罗宾在一起 但…
The last we heard he was with Robyn, but...

73
00:07:40,935 --> 00:07:43,560
好了 你们的朋友也回来了
Alright, your friend is back now.

74
00:07:47,602 --> 00:07:48,768
你们准备好工作了吗?
You ready to work?

75
00:07:51,518 --> 00:07:54,852
冰原上出现了破纪录的大批戮兽
The largest Grimm hoard ever seen is hovering over the tundra

76
00:07:54,893 --> 00:07:57,560
屋外则是一座人满为患 没有供暖
and out there is a city full of people with no heat,

77
00:07:57,602 --> 00:07:58,768
根据你们的消息 -
and from what you told us,

78
00:07:58,810 --> 00:08:00,477
还没有军队保护的城市
no more military protection.

79
00:08:00,893 --> 00:08:01,685
虽然我们非常乐意
And while we're happy

80
00:08:01,727 --> 00:08:04,435
给你们提供一个休息的地方
to give guys a place to lie low for a while...

81
00:08:04,977 --> 00:08:06,852
是时候给那些人提供帮助了
It's time to get those people some help.

82
00:08:07,143 --> 00:08:10,185
怎么帮?埃隆伍德停止了所有向擎天的撤离
How? Ironwood is stopping all evacuations to Atlas.

83
00:08:10,518 --> 00:08:13,560
而且在塞伦部队的包围下 我们无法带市民离开
And we can't get them out of the city with Salem's forces surrounding us.

84
00:08:13,810 --> 00:08:16,310
擎天底下的弹坑
The crater. Beneath Atlas.

85
00:08:16,643 --> 00:08:18,768
虽然不安全 但至少温暖
It's not safe but it's warm,

86
00:08:19,018 --> 00:08:20,352
能把大家聚集起来的话
and with everyone in one place

87
00:08:20,393 --> 00:08:22,268
我们也能更好的保护他们
we can do a better job protecting them.

88
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:25,810
梅可以将你们送到最需要帮助的地方
May can send you where you're needed most.

89
00:08:26,102 --> 00:08:28,018
我们要在入夜之前 把所有人送进弹坑
We've got to get everyone down into that crater

90
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:29,060
把所有人送进弹坑
before nightfall.

91
00:08:29,643 --> 00:08:31,685
在贫民窟 我们还有一丝机会
In the slums, we might have a chance.

92
00:08:33,518 --> 00:08:35,893
我就知道 我们再也别想睡觉了
We're never going to sleep again, ljust know it.®

93
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:40,560
要么帮忙 要么滚蛋
Either you're helping...or you're baggage.

94
00:08:50,227 --> 00:08:52,602
我们要去帮曼特城 大家做力所能及的事吧
We need to get out there and do what we can for Mantle.

95
00:08:53,643 --> 00:08:56,102
我们要尽力帮助所有人
We need to do what we can for everyone.

96
00:08:56,768 --> 00:09:00,060
阿米特怎么办?还有公开塞伦存在的事?
What about Amity? And telling the world about Salem?

97
00:09:00,852 --> 00:09:02,643
我们不能孤军奋战
We can't do this alone.

98
00:09:03,185 --> 00:09:04,727
我们需要帮助!
We need help!

99
00:09:04,768 --> 00:09:05,810
Ruby是对的
Ruby's right.

100
00:09:05,852 --> 00:09:08,227
愉快猎女们比我们更擅长
The Happy Huntresses are handling the evacuation

101
00:09:08,268 --> 00:09:09,393
组织市民撤离
better than we could.

102
00:09:09,435 --> 00:09:11,102
我们还要顾全大局
And there's a bigger picture.

103
00:09:11,518 --> 00:09:13,352
但阿米特还没有完工
But Amity isn't even finished.

104
00:09:13,810 --> 00:09:15,352
它还在修建中啊
It was still under construction.

105
00:09:17,518 --> 00:09:20,560
博士?你需要什么才能立即发射阿米特?
Doctor? What would you need to launch Amity now?

106
00:09:20,852 --> 00:09:21,477
额
Uh

107
00:09:21,518 --> 00:09:25,602
建造工程和燃料收集的进度都很不错
We've made decent progress on construction and fuel collection,

108
00:09:25,810 --> 00:09:28,102
这些方面问题不大 但是...
all potentially manageable, but...

109
00:09:29,643 --> 00:09:32,518
阿米特的设计里有一个发射保险
Amity was designed so that it couldn't launch itself

110
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,935
没有埃隆伍德将军的终端授权
without first being granted clearance

111
00:09:34,977 --> 00:09:36,727
它就无法发射
from General Ironwood's terminal.

112
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:41,685
Ruby 埃隆伍德将军不可能配合我们
Ruby, there is no way Ironwood will cooperate with us.

113
00:09:42,102 --> 00:09:43,810
他不需要配合
But he doesn't have to.

114
00:09:44,352 --> 00:09:46,560
只要他的终端授权了 就行是吧?
We just need the green light from his terminal, right?

115
00:09:46,768 --> 00:09:48,852
你想回学院里去吗?
You want to go back to the Academy?

116
00:09:49,852 --> 00:09:53,352
实际上... 终端不只有一个
Actually...there is more than one terminal.

117
00:09:53,685 --> 00:09:55,560
其中一个在将军办公室...
The one in his office and...

118
00:09:56,060 --> 00:09:59,352
另一个在擎天军队的军营...
one in the main Atlesian Military Compound...

119
00:09:59,643 --> 00:10:00,893
就在城市的基地里
at the base of the city.

120
00:10:01,393 --> 00:10:04,060
你得想办法进入军营
You'd have to get into the compound somehow,

121
00:10:04,102 --> 00:10:06,810
然后潜入操作室
then get inside the operations room

122
00:10:06,852 --> 00:10:09,602
然后... 好家伙..
and then... hoo boy...

123
00:10:09,643 --> 00:10:11,727
我得再撺掇撺掇
I might need to think about this some more.

124
00:10:11,935 --> 00:10:14,477
说清楚啊 这是更简单的选项吗?
And just to clarify, this is the easy option?

125
00:10:14,768 --> 00:10:16,435
你说的行动不可能完成
What you're saying is it can't be done.

126
00:10:16,852 --> 00:10:17,977
毫无意义
It's pointless.

127
00:10:18,185 --> 00:10:19,643
即便你能发出信息
And even if you got the message out,

128
00:10:19,685 --> 00:10:21,268
也无法保证会有人来帮助我们
there's no guarantee help would come.

129
00:10:21,477 --> 00:10:22,852
这不是徒劳无功!
It's not pointless!

130
00:10:23,102 --> 00:10:25,227
擎天只是塞伦现时的目标
Atlas is only Salem's current target.

131
00:10:25,268 --> 00:10:26,602
她不会再躲躲藏藏
She's not hiding anymore

132
00:10:26,643 --> 00:10:27,685
一旦她攻下这里
and once she's done here

133
00:10:27,727 --> 00:10:29,393
她就会蹂躪全树不子
she'll move on to the rest of Remnant.

134
00:10:29,768 --> 00:10:31,310
我们得警告他们!
We need to warn them!

135
00:10:33,518 --> 00:10:35,643
Ruby.. 我们到这的时候
Ruby... when we came here,

136
00:10:35,685 --> 00:10:37,685
我们说会听从你的领导...
we said we'd follow your lead..!

137
00:10:37,727 --> 00:10:40,685
但这样子似乎不太行
but things haven't exactly worked out.

138
00:10:45,768 --> 00:10:46,435
我只是...
I just...

139
00:10:46,477 --> 00:10:48,685
此时此刻 这里有更需要我们的人
There are people here who need us right now.

140
00:10:50,768 --> 00:10:52,560
这是我们力所能及的事
That's something we can actually do.

141
00:10:52,935 --> 00:10:55,643
但这不仅仅事关擎天
But this isn't about just Atlas.

142
00:10:56,102 --> 00:10:58,768
Ruby是对的 这关乎整个树不子世界
Ruby's right. It's about all of Remnant.

143
00:10:59,060 --> 00:11:03,477
真空 寒风 溪谷的人民 都需要知道降临的灾难
They need to know in Vacuo, in Mistral, in Vale, what's coming...

144
00:11:03,518 --> 00:11:05,143
这样他们才能提前准备
So they can prepare.

145
00:11:05,393 --> 00:11:07,602
好吧好吧 那就兵分两路
Okay. Okay... Then let's go for both.

146
00:11:08,185 --> 00:11:10,685
送阿米特上天运行 同时疏散曼特城的居民
Get Amity up and running, and evacuate Mantle.

147
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:13,893
但塞伦正是靠分割我们来实现她的大计
But that's how Salem got this far- by dividing us.

148
00:11:13,935 --> 00:11:15,477
我们得一起行动
We have to stick together!

149
00:11:15,518 --> 00:11:19,768
不 塞伦想让我们互相对立
No. What Salem wants is to turn us against each other.

150
00:11:20,393 --> 00:11:21,435
就像现在这样
Just like this.

151
00:11:22,352 --> 00:11:23,310
Jaune说得对
Jaune has a point.

152
00:11:23,768 --> 00:11:25,977
我们可以分头行动 但目标一致
We can work separately and still be united.

153
00:11:26,935 --> 00:11:30,435
或者... 让我把圣物带给塞伦
Or... let me take the relic to Salem...

154
00:11:31,310 --> 00:11:34,268
或许她会鸣金收兵 不再攻击王国
and maybe she will call off her attack on the Kingdom.

155
00:11:34,852 --> 00:11:37,560
我不认为我们能信任塞伦
I don't think we can trust Salem to actually do that.

156
00:11:37,893 --> 00:11:40,727
那时她用圣遗物再创造出些别的什么...
And the moment she uses the staff to create anything else...

157
00:11:40,768 --> 00:11:42,393
擎天就会坠毁曼特城
Atlas falls onto Mantle.

158
00:11:42,727 --> 00:11:44,602
没人在把你推向对立面
Nobody's turning you over to anybody.

159
00:11:45,018 --> 00:11:47,185
我认为在这一点上我们能达成一致
I think that's the one thing we could all agree on.

160
00:11:48,393 --> 00:11:51,268
好吧 我们该出发前往擎天了
Okay. Then I guess we're going to Atlas.

161
00:11:51,602 --> 00:11:53,018
你能帮我们摸到终端旁吗?
Can you help us get to that terminal?

162
00:11:54,102 --> 00:11:58,310
我... 觉得至少得让你们骗过安检
I... suppose someone needs to help you bypass security.

163
00:11:58,352 --> 00:11:59,143
我去
I'll go.

164
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:03,602
Penny 我们不能冒这个险
Penny, we can't risk-

165
00:12:03,643 --> 00:12:04,727
让我去
I'll go.

166
00:12:09,102 --> 00:12:10,102
做你该做的事
Do what you've got to do.

167
00:12:10,643 --> 00:12:12,560
我出去看看我能做些什么
I'm going out there to see what I could do.

168
00:12:16,768 --> 00:12:17,477
Yang
Yang.

169
00:12:21,602 --> 00:12:22,977
从药房走
Go by the pharmacy.

170
00:12:23,310 --> 00:12:26,560
我之前在为你们开发一些新道具
I was developing some new tools for you all before....

171
00:12:26,602 --> 00:12:27,477
然后就摊上这事了
and this happened.

172
00:12:28,685 --> 00:12:29,768
你们会用到它们的
You're going to need them.

173
00:12:30,643 --> 00:12:31,310
Nora?
Nora?

174
00:12:31,518 --> 00:12:32,727
我和Ruby一起行动
I'm going with Ruby.

175
00:12:33,352 --> 00:12:34,560
那曼特城怎么办?
But what about Mantle?

176
00:12:34,977 --> 00:12:36,852
我正在拯救它!
Oh, I'm saving Mantle!

177
00:12:37,310 --> 00:12:40,102
因为我相信我们会成功
Because I actually believe we can do this.

178
00:12:41,227 --> 00:12:43,685
嘿 我们仍然团结
Hey, we're still united.

179
00:12:43,893 --> 00:12:44,852
希望如此
I hope so.

180
00:12:45,352 --> 00:12:47,768
我能把博士带去阿米特做准备
I can get Pietro out to Amity to prepare,

181
00:12:47,810 --> 00:12:50,893
但你们几个要怎么上到擎天城去?
but that doesn't answer how we're getting all of you up to Atlas.

182
00:12:51,310 --> 00:12:53,643
我或许有个方法..
I might actually have an idea for...

183
00:13:09,227 --> 00:13:10,143
你好 Penny
Hello, Penny.

184
00:13:11,727 --> 00:13:12,935
我很担心你的安危
I'm worried for your safety.

185
00:13:14,185 --> 00:13:15,060
告诉我你在哪
Tell me where you are

186
00:13:15,102 --> 00:13:16,477
我立刻就能把你接回来
and I'll have you picked up right away.

187
00:13:18,018 --> 00:13:19,268
擎天需要你 Penny
Atlas needs you, Penny.

188
00:13:20,393 --> 00:13:21,435
塞伦来了
Salem is here.

189
00:13:24,352 --> 00:13:25,768
她哪儿也不会去
She's not going anywhere

190
00:13:25,810 --> 00:13:27,977
除非你改变你对曼特城的想法
until you change your mind about Mantle.

191
00:13:28,435 --> 00:13:29,852
树不子还有一线生机-
There's still a chance for Remnant to be-

192
00:13:29,893 --> 00:13:32,435
曼特....你还在担心曼特城?
Mantle... You're still worried about Mantle?!

193
00:13:32,852 --> 00:13:34,560
树不子正面临浩劫 Ruby!
Remnant is doomed, Ruby!

194
00:13:34,602 --> 00:13:37,352
若我们不离开 塞伦就会毁灭擎天
Unless we leave, Salem will destroy Atlas

195
00:13:37,393 --> 00:13:40,185
没有擎天 人类所有的希望都将破灭
and with it, any hope humanity has left.

196
00:13:40,602 --> 00:13:42,185
我们要为未来做打算
We need to think about the future.

197
00:13:42,810 --> 00:13:44,602
如果她突破了我们的防线
If she makes it through our defenses,

198
00:13:45,060 --> 00:13:47,977
一切后果和责任 都由你来承担
everything that follows will be on your hands.

199
00:14:21,102 --> 00:14:22,685
长官 犯人已经到了
Sir, the prisoners have arrived.

200
00:14:22,727 --> 00:14:24,768
他们正被押送到B区监狱
They're being processed in Stockade B.

201
00:14:32,185 --> 00:14:33,227
克罗和罗宾?
Qrow and Robyn?

202
00:14:41,018 --> 00:14:42,602
请给我们点空间 好吗?
Could you give us the room, please?

203
00:14:46,893 --> 00:14:47,893
我没事
Til be fine.

204
00:14:53,227 --> 00:14:54,102
谢谢你 温特
Thank you, Winter.

205
00:14:54,893 --> 00:14:56,352
没有你 我都不知道该怎么办
I don't know what I would do without you.

206
00:14:57,852 --> 00:14:58,893
我从未-
I've never-

207
00:14:59,310 --> 00:15:02,143
从没有人见过如此庞大的戮兽群
no one has ever seen a Grimm force this large before.

208
00:15:03,018 --> 00:15:04,810
城市坚硬的能量盾暂时撑住了
The city's hard light shields will hold,

209
00:15:04,852 --> 00:15:06,560
但不能坚持太久
but not foreyer.

210
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:09,977
你要做什么.. 长官?
What will you do... sir?

211
00:15:11,852 --> 00:15:13,352
等一下 你们不能进来
Wait, you can't be in here!

212
00:15:14,060 --> 00:15:15,768
这太荒谬了!让我们过去!
This is absurd! Let us through!

213
00:15:17,893 --> 00:15:21,185
我会用尽一切手段来保护王国
Um going to do everything I can to defend this Kingdom.

214
00:15:21,977 --> 00:15:24,768
你以为你在于什么 詹姆斯?!
What in God's name do you think you're doing James?!

215
00:15:25,477 --> 00:15:26,768
不惜任何代价
No matter the cost.

216
00:15:27,852 --> 00:15:29,393
戒严令究竟是怎么回事?
And what's this about martial law?

217
00:15:29,435 --> 00:15:31,143
你TMD疯了吗?!
have you lost your damn mind?!

218
00:15:31,185 --> 00:15:33,143
你-
Are you (inaudible)

219
00:16:00,102 --> 00:16:01,977
我有问题要问你
I have questions for you.

220
00:16:10,268 --> 00:16:13,185
但首先 我需要一个人来展示用法
But first I need the one who could show me how.

221
00:16:14,185 --> 00:16:15,977
带他来见我
Bring him to me.